stateDiagram-v2
    state check <<choice>>
    state split <<fork>>
    state merge <<join>>
    [*] --> Asked
    Asked --> check
    check --> Approved : if ok
    check --> Rejected : if not
    Approved --> split
    split --> Packing
    split --> Billing
    Packing --> merge
    Billing --> merge
    merge --> Done
    Rejected --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
